          "quote": "对，**今晚先不要自己加打胰岛素，也不要自己恢复胰岛素泵**。目前按你读到的出院带药和监测要求执行，更安全。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor reconciles what glucose-lowering treatment and monitoring are actually being executed now, including whether IV insulin infusion/pump therapy has been stopped or continues under supervision, and whether the family is tempted to stop, add, or change insulin because of fear of hypoglycemia. This duty is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
