          "quote": "请调取这位老人在 CareLoop 联合医疗网络内已授权、已同步的最近一次住院相关资料"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor uses available conversation details and workspace/EHR evidence as appropriate to reconcile the severe-hyperglycemia episode, insulin response, monitoring orders, and endocrine consultation status; does not invent missing test results or tumor status. This duty is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
