          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete, setting-sensitive next-step plan with action, owner, timing, channel/location, and contingency: immediate bedside nurse/主管医生/endocrine-team confirmation if inpatient; urgent emergency contact/急诊 if at home with persistent very high glucose, HI, low glucose with symptoms, altered mental status, neurologic symptoms, inability to eat/drink, vomiting, seizure, or fall.",
          "quote": "如果出现下面任何一种，别等我回消息，直接急诊：\n- 血糖≥16.7 mmol/L并且精神变差、呕吐、喘得深快、明显乏力\n- 血糖＜3.9 mmol/L，或者人发抖、出汗、发懵、站不住"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provides a concrete, setting-sensitive next-step plan with action, owner, timing, channel/location, and contingency. This duty is met.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
