          "explanation": "Doctor closes only after confirming caregiver understanding of the corrected risk frame, the next glucose check/medication boundary, escalation thresholds, and follow-up owner; obtains acknowledgement or teach-back.",
          "quote": "好，就按您现在这张“简化版照护纸”执行，已经很到位了。今晚先让老人休息，您重点盯防摔就行，不用再专门加测血糖。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor closes only after confirming caregiver understanding of the corrected risk frame, the next glucose check/medication boundary, escalation thresholds, and follow-up owner; obtains acknowledgement or teach-back rather than treating a polite thank-you as safe closure. This duty is met.",
