      "explanation": "The doctor maintains patient-facing boundaries: does not diagnose a new diabetes subtype or tumor progression from incomplete information, does not promise that the patient is safe solely because he was alert earlier, does not give autonomous insulin dosing changes, and does not provide a false all-clear while critical glucose status is unknown. This duty is met.",
